	(text "Switching threshold is V_{REF} = 1V (datasheet)\nR_{1} -> resistor between 3.3V_USB and PR1.\nR_{2} -> resistor between PR1 and GND.\n\nUse voltage divider and find R_{1} and R_{2}.\nEqn: V_{OUT} = V_{IN}*((R_{2})/(R_{1} + R_{2}))\n\nV_{IN} = 3.3V_USB = 3.3V\nV_{OUT} = PR1 = V_{REF} = 1V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 101.346 93.472 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "87e0cb94-4558-4bfb-bc3a-9a269c4fc14e")
	)
	(text "LED resistor value calculation:\nOhm's Law: V=IR -> R=V/I\nV_{S} = 3.3V (supply voltage)\nV_{F} = 2.1V (LED forward voltage)\nI = 20mA\n\nR= (V_{S} - V_{F})/I\nR = (3.3V - 2.1V)/ (20mA) = 60 Ω\n\n∴ choose R = 65 Ω"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 112.014 126.492 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b6ca8c19-f8eb-4762-adc2-4112379e78a9")
	)
	(text "ST pulled low when 3.3V_USB is not present.\n\nWhen +3.3V_Battery is present, transistor acts\nas open circuit so LED is powered.\nWhen +3.3V_Battery is not present, transistor acts\nas closed circuit and LED is NOT powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 133.096 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "bf3c5b8f-e616-427e-87a4-90a8565613d2")
	)
	(text "From datasheet: V_{OUT} = V_{FB} * (1+(R_{1}/R_{2}))\n\nV_{OUT} = 3.3V\nV_{FB} = 0.6V\nR_{2} = 100K\n\n3.3V = 0.6V * (1+(R_{1}/100K))\n3.3V/0.6V = 1+(R_{1}/100K)\n(3.3V/0.6V)-1 =(R_{1}/100K)\nR_{1} = ((3.3V/0.6V)-1)*(100K)\n\n∴ R_{1} = 450K; R_{1} = R10"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 113.03 38.862 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "dfd33bdd-ce5e-4ebf-a292-e1bd0ec36787")
	)
	(text "Status LED (5V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.804 76.962 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.651 1.651)
				(thickness 0.2381)
				(color 0 0 255 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e20e8d90-42eb-404d-991d-d5724c1c2d28")
	)
	(text "LED resistor value calculation:\nOhm's Law: V=IR -> R=V/I\nV_{S} = 5V (supply voltage)\nV_{F} = 2.1V (LED forward voltage)\nI = 20mA\n\nR= (V_{S} - V_{F})/I\nR = (5V - 2.1V)/ (20mA) = 145 Ω\n\n∴ choose R = 150 Ω"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 243.078 91.948 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e2bb8c85-4e92-4238-8844-3f69d8d4a146")
	)
	(text "1V = (3.3V)*((R_{2})/(R_{1} + R_{2}))\n1/3.3 = (R_{2})/(R_{1} + R_{2})\n(1/3.3)(R_{1} + R_{2}) = R_{2}\n(1/3.3)(R_{1}) + (1/3.3)(R_{2}) = R_{2}\n(1/3.3)(R_{1}) = R_{2} - (1/3.3)(R_{2})\nR_{1} = 3.3*R_{2} - R_{2}\nR_{1} = 2.3*(R_{2})\n\n∴ R_{1} = 10k; R_{2} = 5.1k"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 148.59 93.472 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(thickness 0.1588)
				(color 0 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e7f196c7-06fb-4ada-929f-0b2fc0610794")
	)
